    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Tremor of the writing hand for six months, with shaky, effortful handwriting and spilling from cups; under evaluation: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Hazardous drinking (AUDIT 12; about 24 standard drinks a week with heavier evenings with friends), without an alcohol use disorder; raised GGT: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
